{%- comment -%}
  Post-purchase "Merci" banner shown at the very top of the Programme page.

  It stays hidden by default and is only revealed when the visitor arrives from
  a confirmed INOUBLIABLE purchase, i.e. when the URL carries the `?merci`
  flag added by the Chariow redirect (see snippets/chariow-product-widget.liquid).

  It never links to the ebook file: the page is public, so access to the book
  stays delivered by Chariow (email / customer space).
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="chariow-thankyou" data-chariow-thankyou hidden>
  <div class="chariow-thankyou__inner">
    <p class="chariow-thankyou__title">Merci pour ton achat ! 🎉</p>
    <p class="chariow-thankyou__text">
      Ton ebook <strong>INOUBLIABLE</strong> vient de t'être envoyé par email
      (via Chariow) — pense à vérifier tes spams si tu ne le vois pas tout de suite.
      Envie d'aller plus loin ? Découvre le programme d'accompagnement ci-dessous 👇
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .chariow-thankyou {
    background: #FFCC00;
    color: #111111;
    border-block-end: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 12%);
  }

  .chariow-thankyou__inner {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: 18px max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left)) 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .chariow-thankyou__title {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .chariow-thankyou__text {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .chariow-thankyou[data-revealed] {
      animation: chariow-thankyou-in 320ms ease-out both;
    }

    @keyframes chariow-thankyou-in {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(-8px);
      }

      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  (function () {
    var banner = document.querySelector('[data-chariow-thankyou]');
    if (!banner) return;

    var params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
    if (!params.has('merci')) return;

    banner.hidden = false;
    banner.setAttribute('data-revealed', '');
  })();
</script>
